Reductive Thinking

        What part of this problem is fake complexity or unnecessary?

        Example
              Ants/People Colliding on a Plank

        How
            Instead of simulating collisions, realize collision between identical objects is mathematically 
            equivalent to passing through each other. 
            So, complex interaction becomes independent movement

        Fails when
            The interaction actually changes future state/identity/outcome.
            Example
                Robot with changing direction/state after collision, or 
                games where collisions modify energy/score/state.
                

Brain removes interactions assuming they are irrelevant, but here interactions genuinely alter future system behavior.
        


        
        
